      {
        "id": "note-create-ai",
        "type": "note",
        "annotationKey": "create-ai-logic",
        "x": 820,
        "y": 55,
        "width": 290,
        "height": 190,
        "text": "AI 分析输入：规范化域名、界面语言、Firecrawl 首页 Markdown 与 metadata。模型一次输出产品名称、目标用户、痛点、使用场景、解决方案和目标国家。"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-create-confirm",
        "type": "note",
        "annotationKey": "create-confirm-logic",
        "x": 820,
        "y": 310,
        "width": 290,
        "height": 180,
        "text": "AI 只负责预填写。全部字段允许手动修改；目标国家以 Tag 多选。用户确认后的 product_profile.json 才写入 Brain AI。"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-create-audit",
        "type": "note",
        "annotationKey": "create-audit-logic",
        "x": 820,
        "y": 550,
        "width": 290,
        "height": 160,
        "text": "确认创建项目后，系统立即创建 technical_seo_audit 任务，并复用当前 Technical SEO 执行逻辑。"
      },
