      {
        "id": "frame-famesquared-competitor-research",
        "type": "frame",
        "title": "竞品研究 · 竞品详情",
        "device": "desktop",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2400,
        "width": 1440,
        "height": 1000,
        "projectId": "famesquared",
        "componentId": "competitor-research",
        "componentPath": "./components/famesquared/competitor-research/index.html"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-competitor-navigation",
        "type": "note",
        "annotationKey": "competitor-navigation-logic",
        "x": 1490,
        "y": 2445,
        "width": 310,
        "height": 190,
        "text": "左侧导航按竞品名单保存顺序排列，默认选中第一个竞品。每项只展示网站 Logo 和域名；右侧展示产品名称，并将月自然流量与方向箭头、变化百分比合并为一个指标，避免重复。"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-competitor-switch",
        "type": "note",
        "annotationKey": "competitor-switch-logic",
        "x": 1490,
        "y": 2695,
        "width": 310,
        "height": 205,
        "text": "点击竞品后更新右侧全部详情，并保留当前 Tab 与目标市场。搜索、排序和分页重置为新竞品的默认状态。"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-competitor-tabs",
        "type": "note",
        "annotationKey": "competitor-tabs-logic",
        "x": 1490,
        "y": 2960,
        "width": 310,
        "height": 235,
        "text": "默认打开高流量页面。该 Tab 只展示页面 URL 与月自然流量，保留 URL 搜索和流量排序。高价值外链只展示引用域名、引用域名月自然流量和 Domain Rank。"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-competitor-filters",
        "type": "note",
        "annotationKey": "competitor-filters-logic",
        "x": 1490,
        "y": 3235,
        "width": 310,
        "height": 190,
        "text": "目标市场是整个竞品研究模块的 DataForSEO location + language 上下文。高价值外链详情针对当前竞品，不提供筛选和搜索。引用域名月自然流量是该域名自身在当前市场的 DataForSEO organic ETV；切换市场时该值更新，Domain Rank 不变。"
      },
      {
