      {
        "id": "note-competitor-init-states",
        "type": "note",
        "annotationKey": "competitor-init-states-logic",
        "x": 1490,
        "y": 3645,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 210,
        "text": "无 artifacts 且无初始化任务时显示 idle 示例和“获取竞品数据”。任务 queued/running 时继续展示示例、进度和“查看任务”。初始化失败时保留示例并显示“重新获取”。原型状态：?state=idle、loading、failed、ready。"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-competitor-init-task",
        "type": "note",
        "annotationKey": "competitor-init-task-logic",
        "x": 1490,
        "y": 3915,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 205,
        "text": "获取按钮只在没有 competitor_research 初始化任务时创建任务。queued/running 阶段不得重复创建。首次获取和系统失败后的重新获取均不消耗手动刷新额度。"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-competitor-fixture-safety",
        "type": "note",
        "annotationKey": "competitor-fixture-safety-logic",
        "x": 1490,
        "y": 4180,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 205,
        "text": "示例 fixture 固定为前端展示数据，所有示例态均明确标记“示例数据”。fixture 不写入 workspace 或 Brain AI，不生成 artifact，不得被关键词、内容、外链等后续模块读取。"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-competitor-ready-gate",
        "type": "note",
        "annotationKey": "competitor-ready-gate-logic",
        "x": 1490,
        "y": 4445,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 150,
        "text": "competitor-list.json、competitor-pages.json、competitor-keywords.json、competitor-backlinks.json 四份真实 artifacts 全部通过 Schema 校验后，整体替换示例并进入 ready 页面。"
      },
